. The elevator entrance is off the northwest side of the museum parking lot.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"appleton-public-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Appleton Public Library","title":"Claim a Downtown Reading Stop","subtitle":"Saturday late afternoon · Visit 200 North Appleton Street","notes":"Browse the new-to-you building, identify quiet and collaborative areas, and ask staff about cards, events, and services available to students.","short_summary":"The municipal library expands your study map into downtown Appleton.","evidence_claim":"Appleton Public Library’s official page gives its 200 North Appleton Street location and public hours, including Saturday service from 9 a.m.–5 p.m.","source_url":"https://apl.org/about/","source_title":"About | Appleton Public Library","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Saturday hours are 9 a.m.–5 p.m. and Sunday hours are noon–5 p.m.; borrowing privileges and reservable services may require registration.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lawrence-memorial-chapel","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Lawrence Memorial Chapel","title":"Hear the Chapel in Use","subtitle":"Saturday evening · Choose a listed performance","notes":"Consult the university calendar for a public concert or recital, confirm whether tickets are required, and arrive early enough to find the entrance.","short_summary":"A scheduled performance introduces the Conservatory through one of Lawrence’s principal venues.","evidence_claim":"Lawrence identifies Memorial Chapel as a 1,184-seat venue used for ensemble concerts, public events, convocations, and the Performing Arts Series.","source_url":"https://www.lawrence.edu/conservatory/music-arts/box-office/venues","source_title":"Performing Arts Venues | Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Access is event-dependent. Exterior doors may be locked; the box-office number is posted for entry assistance. Photography and recording are prohibited during performances.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lawrence-buchanan-kiewit-wellness-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Buchanan Kiewit Wellness Center","title":"Reset Before Monday","subtitle":"Sunday · Try a low-key recreation session","notes":"Bring your Lawrence ID, check facility availability, and choose a manageable activity such as the track, pool, gym, or checked-out recreation equipment.","short_summary":"A short Sunday workout closes the weekend with a repeatable campus routine.","evidence_claim":"Lawrence lists a pool, gymnasium, jogging track, weight and cardio rooms, and other facilities at the Buchanan Kiewit Wellness Center.","source_url":"https://www.lawrence.edu/offices/wellness-services","source_title":"Wellness Services | Lawrence University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A valid Lawrence ID is required. Academic Sunday building hours are listed as 10 a.m.–11 p.m.; pool and space availability follow separate schedules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
